tip: | Look at the duck. | A curve for the back, a curve for the neck, a dot for an eye. At this size one misplaced pixel changes the animal.
tip: 1 | Two ovals. | A low wide one and a small high one, joined by a neck. Any bird starts like this.
tip: | Try it. | The bill and feet are the only warm pixels. Move the eye one pixel with the Pencil and see how much the duck changes. | pencil
